<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ZEC" style="id"/>
  <para style="h">Nabi Sakari Sora</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nabi Sakari Alaa Falan Naxan Sɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Sakari</para>
  <para style="mt1">Sakari</para>
  <para style="mt2">Nabi Sakari Alaa Falan Naxan Sɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="ip">Nabi Sakari a nabiya falani itoe sɛbɛxi nɛn yanyina nde ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ suulun ɲɛɛ mɔxɔɲɛ benun Marigi Yesu xa bari. E nun Nabi Xage yi walima waxati kedenna nin. Yuda bɔnsɔnna muxune bata yi keli konyiyani Babilɔn taani. E katama e mɔn xa Ala Batu Banxin ti.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabun yireni ito yitaxunxi dɔxɔ firin. Sakari sora keden han sora solomasɛxɛna, na fe toone nan yɛbama naxanye luxi alo xiyena. Ne bunna nɛɛn fa fala yamaan mɔn na Yerusalɛn taan nun Ala Batu Banxin ti, na findima waxati nɛnɛn nan na Alaa muxune xa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabun yireni ito bode fɔxɔn waxatina nde a fe falama, manga faɲina nde yi fama Alaa mangayaan na waxatin naxan yi Isirayila yamanani (Sakari 9 han Sakari 12). Na nabiya falane Marigi Yesu a fe falaxi ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ suulun benun a xa liga. Na mato Sakari 9.9 nun 11.12-13 nun 12.10 nun 13.7 kui. A fe mɔn sɛbɛxi Matiyu 21.4-5 nun Matiyu 26.31 nun Maraka 14.27 nun Yoni 19.37 kui.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ZEC 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:1"/>Dariyusi a mangayaan ɲɛɛ firinden kike solomasɛxɛdeni, Alatala yi falan ti Nabi Sakari xa, Bereki a dii xɛmɛna, Yido mamandenna. A naxa:<verse eid="ZEC 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:2"/>“Alatala xɔlɔ gbeen ti nɛn ɛ benbane xili ma. <verse eid="ZEC 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:3"/>Koni, i xa a fala e xa fa fala Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna naxa iki: ‘Ɛ mɔn xa fa n ma,’ Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna ito nan falaxi, a naxa, ‘N fan fama nɛn ɛ ma.’ Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna falan nan na ra. <verse eid="ZEC 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:4"/>Ɛ nama lu alo ɛ benbane, nabi fonne yi ito ralima naxanye ma: Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna ito nan falaxi, a naxa, ‘Ɛ xɛtɛ ɛ fe ɲaxine nun ɛ kɛwali ɲaxine fɔxɔ ra.’ Koni e mi e tuli mati, e mi n xuiin namɛ. Alatalaa falan nan na ra. <verse eid="ZEC 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:5"/>Ɛ benbane minɛn? Nabine go? E ɲɛɲɛ habadan? <verse eid="ZEC 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:6"/>Anu, n falane nun sariyan naxanye yamari nabine ma, n ma walikɛne, ne xa mi ɛ benbane li ba? Nayi e yi tubi, e yi a fala, e naxa, ‘Naxan lanxi nxɔ feene nun kɛwanle ma, Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna bata na nan liga nxu ra alo a bata yi a ragidi kii naxan yi.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fe to singena alo xiyena: Soone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:7"/>Kike fu nun kedenden xii mɔxɔɲɛn nun naanindena, Sebati kikena, Dariyusi a mangayaan ɲɛɛ firindena, Alatala yi falan ti Nabi Sakari xa, Bereki a dii xɛmɛna, Yido mamandenna.<verse eid="ZEC 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:8"/>N fe toon tixi nɛn kɔɛɛn na alo xiyena. N soo ragina nde nan to soo gbeela fari, a yi tixi miriti wudine tagi darani. Soo gbeele, a gbeeli makatunxine e nun a fixɛne yi a xanbi ra. <verse eid="ZEC 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:9"/>N yi a maxɔdin, n naxa, “Nanse itoe ra, n kanna?” Malekan naxan yi falan tima n xa, na yi n yabi, a naxa, “N xa a yita i ra naxan e ra.” <verse eid="ZEC 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:10"/>Muxun naxan yi tixi miriti wudine tagi, na yi a fala, a naxa, “Alatala ne nan xɛxi bɔxɔni sigadeni.” <verse eid="ZEC 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:11"/>E yi dɛntɛgɛn sa Alatala malekan xa naxan yi tixi miriti wudine tagi, e naxa, “Nxu bata bɔxɔn birin yisiga, bɔxɔn muxune birin sabatixi bɔɲɛ xunbenli.” <verse eid="ZEC 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:12"/>Nayi, Alatalaa malekan yi a fala, a naxa, “Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna, i mi tinma kininkininɲɛ Yerusalɛn nun Yuda taane ma han waxatin mundun yi, i xɔlɔxi naxanye ma xabu ɲɛɛ tonge solofere?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1.12</char> <char style="fk">ɲɛɛ tonge solofere:</char> Na mato Yeremi 25.11 nun Yeremi 29.10 kui.</note> <verse eid="ZEC 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:13"/>Malekan naxan yi falan tima n xa, Alatala yi fala faɲine ti na xa, a yi a masabari.<verse eid="ZEC 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:14"/>Malekan naxan yi falan tima n xa, na yi a fala n xa, a n xa falani ito rali: “Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna ito nan falaxi, a naxa, ‘Xɔxɔlɔn gbeena n yi Yerusalɛn nun Siyon ma fe ra.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1.14</char> Ala <char style="fk">xɔxɔlɔn,</char> bayo e nun a yamaan bata yi layirin xidi alo futun xidima kii naxan yi. Na kui, Ala a yamaan masuxuma alo xɛmɛna a ɲaxanla makantanma kii naxan yi. A mi tinma a xa bira se gbɛtɛ fɔxɔ ra a batu xinla ma, a mɔn mi tinma yama xɔɲɛn xa a raxɔri. Na feen mato Xɔrɔyaan 20.5 kui.</note> <verse eid="ZEC 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:15"/>Siya gbɛtɛn naxanye bɔɲɛ xunbenli, n bata xɔlɔ ne ma han! Amasɔtɔ n yi xɔlɔxi nɛn ndedi, koni e tan bata yihadin fari sa.’ <verse eid="ZEC 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:16"/>Nanara, Alatala ito nan falaxi, a naxa, ‘N mɔn fama nɛn Yerusalɛn taani kininkininni, n ma banxin mɔn yi ti. Se maliga lutin mɔn yibandunma nɛn Yerusalɛn taan xun ma.’ Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna falan nan na ra. <verse eid="ZEC 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:17"/>I mɔn xa ito rali: Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna ito nan falaxi, a naxa, ‘Ɲaxunna mɔn soma nɛn n ma taane yi. Alatala mɔn Siyon muxune madɛndɛnma nɛn, a mɔn yi Yerusalɛn sugandi.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 1:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ZEC 2"/>
  <para style="s">Fe toon firindena alo xiyena: Fenne nun xabune</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:1"/>N yi n yɛɛn nakeli n yi fe toon ti alo xiye. Feri naanin yi n yɛtagi. <verse eid="ZEC 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:2"/>Malekan naxan yi falan tima n xa, n yi na maxɔdin, n naxa, “Nanse itoe ra?” A yi n yabi, a naxa, “Sɛnbɛne nan e ra naxanye Yuda nun Isirayila nun Yerusalɛn raxuyaxi ayi.”<verse eid="ZEC 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:3"/>Na xanbi ra, Alatala yi xabu naanin yita n na. <verse eid="ZEC 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:4"/>N yi maxɔdinna ti, n naxa, “Itoe faxi nanse ligadeyi be?” A yi n yabi, a naxa, “Fenni itoe nan Yuda raxuyaxi ayi fefe, han muxu yo mi fa nɔɛ a xunni tɛ. Koni xabuni itoe tan faxi e magaxudeni, e yi siya gbɛtɛne sɛnbɛne rabira, naxanye kelixi Yuda bɔxɔn xili ma alogo e xa Yuda kaane raxuya ayi.”<verse eid="ZEC 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fe toon saxandena alo xiyena: Se maliga lutina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:5"/>N yi n yɛɛn nakeli n yi fe toon ti alo xiye. Se maliga lutin yi suxi muxuna nde yii. <verse eid="ZEC 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:6"/>N yi a maxɔdin, n naxa, “I sigan minɛn?” A yi n yabi, a naxa, “N Yerusalɛn nan maligama, alogo n xa a yigboon nun a kuyan kolon.”<verse eid="ZEC 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:7"/>Malekan naxan yi falan tima n xa, na yi siga, koni maleka gbɛtɛ yi fa na ralan. <verse eid="ZEC 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:8"/>A yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “I gi, sa a fala banxulanni ito xa, a Yerusalɛn kaane nun xuruseene wuyama ayi nɛn han! Yinna mi fa nɔɛ taan nabilinɲɛ. <verse eid="ZEC 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:9"/>Alatalaa falan ni ito ra, a naxa, ‘N tan yɛtɛna a kantanma nɛn alo tɛɛna a rabilinni, n yi n nɔrɔn nagodo a yi.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:10"/>“Ɛ xɔdɔxɔ de!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:10">Ɛ gi kɔmɛn fɔxɔn yamanan bun!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:10">Alatalaa falan nan na ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:10">“Bayo n na ɛ raxuya ayi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:10">bɔxɔn tongon naaninne ma.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:10">Alatalaa falan nan na ra.<verse eid="ZEC 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:11"/>“Ɛ xɔdɔxɔ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:11">Siyon kaane, ɛ gi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:11">ɛ tan naxanye dɔxi Babilɔn yi.”<verse eid="ZEC 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:12"/>Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna naxa iki:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:12">“A bata n xɛ binyeni siyane ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:12">naxanye fuxi ɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:12">bayo naxan na a yiin din ɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:12">a luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:12">alo na bata a yiin din Ala yɛ diin na.<verse eid="ZEC 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:13"/>N kelima nɛn e xili ma yati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:13">e konyine yi e yii seene birin tongo yɛngɛni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:13">Nayi, ɛ a kolonma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:13">a Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna nan n nafaxi.<verse eid="ZEC 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:14"/>Ɛ xuini te sɛwani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:14">ɛ tan Siyon kaane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:14">bayo n fama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:14">n yi lu ɛ tagi.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:14">Alatalaa falan nan na ra.<verse eid="ZEC 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:15"/>Siya wuyaxine fama nɛn Alatala ma na lɔxɔni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:15">e yi findi n ma yamaan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:15">N luma nɛn ɛ tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:15">ɛ yi a kolon</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:15">a Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna nan n nafaxi ɛ ma.<verse eid="ZEC 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:16"/>Yuda mɔn findima nɛn Alatala gbeen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:16">yamana sariɲanxina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:16">a mɔn yi Yerusalɛn sugandi.<verse eid="ZEC 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:17"/>Adamadiin birin xa a dundu Alatala yɛtagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 2:17">amasɔtɔ a bata keli mini a yire sariɲanxini.<verse eid="ZEC 2:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ZEC 3"/>
  <para style="s">Fe toon naanindena alo xiyena: Saraxarali kuntigina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:1"/>A yi saraxarali kuntigi Yosuwe yita n na, a yi tixi Alatalaa malekan yɛtagi. Setana yi tixi a yiifanna ma a tɔɲɛgɛdeni. <verse eid="ZEC 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:2"/>Alatalaa malekan yi a fala Setana xa, a naxa, “Alatala xa falan ti i xili ma, Setana, a xa falan ti i xili ma, a tan naxan Yerusalɛn sugandixi! Tɛɛ yege dungin xa mi yi xɛmɛni ito ra ba naxan baxi tɛɛni?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">3.2</char> Yosuwe ito baxi kelideni Babilɔn taani a yi konyiyani dɛnaxan yi. E nun Yahudiyana ndee nan faxi Yerusalɛn yi.</note> <verse eid="ZEC 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:3"/>Dugi xɔsixine nan yi ragodoxi Yosuwe ma, a yi tixi malekan yɛtagi. <verse eid="ZEC 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:4"/>Naxanye yi tixi a yɛtagi, malekan yi a fala ne xa, a naxa, “Ɛ dugi xɔsixine ba a ma!” A mɔn yi a fala Yosuwe xa, a naxa, “A mato, n bata i hakɛne ba i ma n dugi faɲine ragodo i ma.” <verse eid="ZEC 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:5"/>N yi a fala, n naxa, “E xa namu sariɲanxin so a xunna!” E yi namu sariɲanxin so a xunna, e yi dugine ragodo a ma. Alatala malekan yi tixi na.<verse eid="ZEC 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:6"/>Alatala malekan yi ito rali Yosuwe ma, a naxa, <verse eid="ZEC 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:7"/>“Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna ito nan falaxi, a naxa, ‘Xa i sigan ti n ma kirane xɔn, xa i n ma yamarine suxu, i tan nan dɔxɔma n ma banxin nun n ma tanden xun na, n yi tiden fi i ma itoe yɛ naxanye tixi be. <verse eid="ZEC 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:8"/>Nayi, saraxarali kuntigi Yosuwe, i tan nun i fɔxɔrabiran naxanye dɔxi i yɛtagi, ɛ tuli mati! Amasɔtɔ muxuni itoe findima fe famatɔne taxamasenne nan na. N nan n ma walikɛɛn nafama nɛn, naxan xili “Nimɛna.” <verse eid="ZEC 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:9"/>Amasɔtɔ gɛmɛn mato n naxan dɔxi Yosuwe yɛtagi. Fɔxɔ solofere nan na gɛmɛ kedenna ma. N sɛbɛnla tima nɛn a ma. Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna falan ni ito ra: N yamanani ito hakɛn bama nɛn a ma lɔxɔ kedenni. <verse eid="ZEC 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:10"/>Na lɔxɔni, muxun birin a lanfaan xilima nɛn, e yi dɔxɔ e manpa binla nun xɔdɛ binla nininna ra.’ Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna falan nan na ra.”<verse eid="ZEC 3:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ZEC 4"/>
  <para style="s">Fe toon suulundena alo xiyena: Lɛnpu dɔxɔ sena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:1"/>Malekan naxan yi falan tima n xa nun, na mɔn yi fa, a n nakeli alo muxun naxan naxulunxi xixɔnli. <verse eid="ZEC 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:2"/>A yi n maxɔdin, a naxa, “I nanse toma?” N yi a yabi, n naxa, “N lɛnpu dɔxɔ se xɛma daxin nan toma, e nun ture ramaradena a xuntagi. Lɛnpu solofere a ma. Ture godode solofere nan turen sama lɛnpu soloferene kui. <verse eid="ZEC 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:3"/>Oliwi wudi bili firin tixi ture ramaraden dɛxɔn ma, keden a yiifanna ma, keden a kɔmɛnna ma.” <verse eid="ZEC 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:4"/>Malekan naxan yi falan tima n xa, n yi na maxɔdin, n naxa, “N kanna, nanse itoe ra?” <verse eid="ZEC 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:5"/>A yi n maxɔdin, a naxa, “I mi a kolon?” N yi a yabi, n naxa, “N mi a kolon, n kanna.” <verse eid="ZEC 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:6"/>Nayi, a yi a fala n xa, a naxa, “Alatalaa falan ni i ra, a naxan tixi Sorobabeli ma, a naxa, ‘A mi ligama sɛnbɛn xɔn hanma fangana, koni fɔ n ma Niin barakan nin.’ Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna falan nan na ra.”<verse eid="ZEC 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:7"/>“Hali geya gbeen naxan Sorobabeli yɛɛ ra, na findima nɛn lantaan na. A fama nɛn Ala Batu banxin konde gɛmɛn na, yamaan yi e xuini te, e naxa, ‘Ala xa hinan a ra habadan!’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:8"/>Alatala yi falan ti n xa, a naxa, <verse eid="ZEC 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:9"/>“Sorobabeli bata banxini ito ti fɔlɔ, a mɔn a raɲanma nɛn. Nayi, ɛ a kolonma nɛn a Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna nan n nafaxi ɛ ma. <verse eid="ZEC 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:10"/>Nde feene fɔlɔn magelema nɛn a to xurun? Yamaan ɲaxanma nɛn e na gɛmɛ matinxin seen to Sorobabeli yii.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 4:10">Na lɛnpu soloferene findixi Alatala yɛɛne nan na naxanye bɔxɔn birin yisigama.<verse eid="ZEC 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:11"/>N yi a maxɔdin, n naxa, “Nanse Oliwi wudi firinna ne ra, lɛnpu dɔxɔ seen yiifanna nun a kɔmɛnna ma?” <verse eid="ZEC 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:12"/>N mɔn yi a maxɔdin, n naxa, “Nanse Oliwi wudi yii firinna ne ra, naxanye ture godode xɛma daxi firinne dɛxɔn, oliwi turen danguma naxanye kui?” <verse eid="ZEC 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:13"/>A yi n maxɔdin, a naxa, “I mi a kolon naxan ne ra?” N yi a yabi, n naxa, “N mi e kolon, n kanna.” <verse eid="ZEC 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:14"/>Nayi, a yi a fala n xa, a naxa, “E findixi muxu firinne<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">4.14</char> Na <char style="fk">muxu firinne</char> findixi saraxarali Yosuwe nun yamana kanna Sorobabeli nan na.</note> nan na naxanye masusan turen na alogo e xa wali dunuɲa birin Marigin xa.”<verse eid="ZEC 4:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ZEC 5"/>
  <para style="s">Fe toon sennindena alo xiyena: Danga kɛdina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:1"/>N mɔn yi n yɛɛn nakeli, n fe toon ti alo xiye, n kɛdin mafilinxin to kore. <verse eid="ZEC 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:2"/>Malekan yi a fala n xa, a naxa, “I nanse toma?” N yi a yabi, n naxa, “N kɛdin nan toma kore, a kuya nɔngɔnna yɛ mɔxɔɲɛ, a yigbo nɔngɔnna yɛ fu.”<verse eid="ZEC 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:3"/>Nayi, a yi a fala n xa, a naxa, “Dangan nan na ra naxan xuyama ayi yamanan birin yi. A sɛbɛxi kɛdin fɔxɔ kedenna ma fa fala muɲadene birin kedima nɛn yamanani. A mɔn sɛbɛxi fɔxɔ kedenna boden ma fa fala naxanye birin e kɔlɔma wuleni, ne fan kedima nɛn. <verse eid="ZEC 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:4"/>Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna falan ni ito ra: ‘N dangani ito rafama nɛn, a yi so muɲadene birin ma banxine yi e nun muxun naxanye birin e kɔlɔma wuleni n xinli. A luma nɛn e banxine kui alogo a xa e nun a xalanbene nun a gɛmɛne birin kala.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fe toon soloferedena alo xiyena: Ɲaxanla debedin kui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:5"/>Malekan naxan yi falan tima n xa, na yi a maso, a a fala n xa, a naxa, “I yɛɛn nakeli, i a mato naxan minin be iki.” <verse eid="ZEC 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:6"/>N yi a maxɔdin, n naxa, “Nanse a ra?” A yi n yabi, a naxa, “Liga se debedin nan famatɔ a ra.” A mɔn yi a fala, a naxa, “Na nan toma yamanan muxun birin yi.”<verse eid="ZEC 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:7"/>E yi debedin dɛ raganla yɔxɔ daxini te, n yi ɲaxanla nde to dɔxi a kui. <verse eid="ZEC 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:8"/>Malekan yi a fala n xa, a naxa, “Fe ɲaxin misaala nan ɲaxanli ito ra.” Na xanbi ra, a mɔn yi ɲaxanla madɛtɛn debedin kui, a yi a dɛraganla dɛtɛn a dɛ ra.<verse eid="ZEC 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:9"/>N yi n yɛɛn nakeli, n yi fe toon ti alo xiyena, n yi ɲaxalan firin to tuganɲɛ. Foyen yi e gabutɛne yi alo yaya xɔnla gabutɛne. E yi debedin tongo, e te a ra kore. <verse eid="ZEC 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:10"/>Malekan naxan yi falan tima n xa, n yi na maxɔdin, n naxa, “E debedin xalima minɛn?” <verse eid="ZEC 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:11"/>A yi a fala n xa, a naxa, “E sa banxin nan tima a xa Babilɔn yamanani. Banxin na raɲan, debedin dɔxɔma nɛn mɛnni, e yi a batu.”<verse eid="ZEC 5:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ZEC 6"/>
  <para style="s">Fe toon solomasɛxɛdena alo xiyena: Wontoro naaninne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:1"/>N mɔn yi n yɛɛne rakeli, n yi fe toon ti alo xiye. N wontoro naanin to minɛ geya firinne longonna ra, sulan geyaan nan yi ne ra. <verse eid="ZEC 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:2"/>Soo gbeele nan yi wontoro singen bandunma, a firindena soo fɔrɛne, <verse eid="ZEC 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:3"/>a saxandena, soo fixɛne, a naanindena, soo gbeeli makatunxine. <verse eid="ZEC 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:4"/>Malekan naxan yi falan tima n na, n yi na maxɔdin, n naxa, “Nanse itoe ra n kanna?” <verse eid="ZEC 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:5"/>Malekan yi a fala n xa, a naxa, “Bɔxɔn tongon naaninne foyene nan ne ra. E kelixi dunuɲa birin Marigin nan fɛma. <verse eid="ZEC 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:6"/>Soo fɔrɛne naxan bandunma, na sigama kɔmɛnna yamanan binna nin. Na xanbi ra, a fixɛne nan minima. A makatunxine sigama yiifanna yamanan binna nin.” <verse eid="ZEC 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:7"/>A gbeeli makatunxine yi mini, e yi wama bɔxɔni siga feni. Malekan yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ siga, ɛ bɔxɔni siga!” E yi bɔxɔni siga. <verse eid="ZEC 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:8"/>A yi n xili, a naxa, “A mato, naxanye sigama kɔmɛnna yamanan binni, ne bata n nii yifan n ma kɔmɛnna yamanani.”<verse eid="ZEC 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yosuwe a mangayana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:9"/>Alatala yi falan ti n xa, a naxa, <verse eid="ZEC 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:10"/>“I xa suxu muxune kiseene rasuxu, Xɛlidayi, Tobiya e nun Yɛdaya. I xa siga Sofoni a dii Yosiya a banxini to, e faxi dɛnaxan yi keli Babilɔn yi. <verse eid="ZEC 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:11"/>I xa gbetin nun xɛmaan tongo. I yi mangaya taxamasenna rafala i yi a so saraxarali kuntigi Yosuwe xun na, Yehosadaki a dii xɛmɛna. <verse eid="ZEC 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:12"/>I xa a fala a xa a Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna ito nan falaxi, a naxa, ‘Muxun ni i ra naxan xili “Nimɛna,” a sabatima nɛn a dɛnaxan yi, a yi Alatala Batu Banxin ti. <verse eid="ZEC 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:13"/>A tan nan Alatala Batu Banxin tima, mangayaan binyen yi lu a tan ma. A dɔxɔma nɛn a mangaya gbɛdɛni, a nɔɔn ti. Saraxaralina nde fan dɔxɔma nɛn a mangaya gbɛdɛni. Bɔɲɛ xunbenla yi lu e firinna tagi.’ <verse eid="ZEC 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:14"/>Mangaya taxamasenna luma nɛn Alatala Batu Banxini ɲɔxɔ lu seen na Xelemi nun Tobiya nun Yɛdaya nun Sofoni a dii Xeni xɔn. <verse eid="ZEC 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:15"/>Muxun naxanye makuya, ne fama nɛn, e wali Alatala Batu Banxin tideni. Nayi, ɛ a kolonma nɛn a Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna nan n nafaxi ɛ ma. Na ligama nɛn, xa ɛ Alatala xuiin namɛ ki faɲi, ɛ Ala.”<verse eid="ZEC 6:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ZEC 7"/>
  <para style="s">Sun suxuna fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:1"/>Dariyusi a mangayaan ɲɛɛ naaninden kike solomanaaninden xii naaninde lɔxɔni, Kisilewi kikena, Alatala yi falan ti Sakari xa. <verse eid="ZEC 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:2"/>Betɛli kaane bata yi Sareseri nun Regemi-Meleki nun e muxune rasiga Alatala maxandideni. <verse eid="ZEC 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:3"/>E yi lan e Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna a saraxaraline nun nabine maxɔdin, e naxa, “Nxu lan nxu yi lu sunuxi ba, nxu lu sunna suxɛ kike suulunden ma ba, alo nxu a liga kii naxan yi ɲɛɛ wuyaxi danguxine yi?”<verse eid="ZEC 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:4"/>Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna yi falan ti n xa, a naxa, <verse eid="ZEC 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:5"/>“A fala yamanan muxune birin xa e nun saraxaraline, i naxa, ‘Ɛ to yi sunna suxuma ɛ yi sunu kike suulundene nun kike soloferedene yi, xabu ɲɛɛ tonge solofere, ɛ yi sunna suxuma n tan nan xa ba? <verse eid="ZEC 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:6"/>Ɛ to yi ɛ dɛgema, ɛ yi ɛ min, ɛ mi yi a ligama ɛ yɛtɛ xan xa ba? <verse eid="ZEC 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:7"/>Alatala mi falan ne xan ti nabi singene xɔn ba, Yerusalɛn nun a rabilinna taane yi sabatixi bɔɲɛ xunbenli waxatin naxan yi, muxune yi dɔxi Negewi nun Sefala geyane yi waxatin naxan yi?’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sariya kɛndɛna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:8"/>Alatala yi falan ti Sakari xa, a naxa, <verse eid="ZEC 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:9"/>“Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna ito nan falaxi, a naxa, ‘Ɛ xa kitin sa tinxinni, ɛ hinan ɛ bode ra, ɛ yi kininkinin. <verse eid="ZEC 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:10"/>Ɛ nama kaɲa gilɛne nun kiridine nun xɔɲɛne nun yiigelitɔne tɔrɔ, ɛ nama miriya ɲaxin tongo ɛ bode xili ma.’ <verse eid="ZEC 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:11"/>Koni e tan mi tin na ramɛ, e yi e xun xanbi so, e yi e tunle dutun. <verse eid="ZEC 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:12"/>E bɔɲɛne yi xɔdɔxɔ ayi alo dayimuna. E yi tondi Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna sariyane ramɛ e nun falane a yi naxanye tima nabi singene xɔn Alaa Niin barakani. Nayi, Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna yi xɔlɔ han! <verse eid="ZEC 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:13"/>Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna naxa, ‘N to yi xinla tima, e mi n natin. E fan na n xili, n mi e ratinma. <verse eid="ZEC 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:14"/>N na e raxuya ayi nɛn siyane birin yɛ e mi naxanye kolon. Yamanani geli nɛn e xanbi. Muxu yo mi yi sigan na, muxu yo mi yi keli na. E yi yamana faɲini geli.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 7:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ZEC 8"/>
  <para style="s">Yerusalɛn mɔn tima nɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:1"/>Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna yi falan ti, a naxa, <verse eid="ZEC 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:2"/>“Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna ito nan falaxi, a naxa, ‘Xɔxɔlɔn gbeena n yi Siyon ma fe ra han. N bɔɲɛn wolonxi a fe ra ki faɲi!’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:3"/>Alatala ito nan falaxi, a naxa, “N mɔn fama nɛn Siyon yi, n yi dɔxɔ Yerusalɛn taani. Yerusalɛn fama nɛn xili badeni ‘ɲɔndi taana.’ Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna geyaan yi xili ba ‘geya sariɲanxina.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:4"/>Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna ito nan falaxi, a naxa, “Xɛmɛ fonne nun ɲaxalan fonne mɔn dɔxɔma nɛn Yerusalɛn taan malandene yi, dunganna suxi e birin yii e siimaya xunkuyena fe ra. <verse eid="ZEC 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:5"/>Taan malandene rafema nɛn dii xɛmɛne nun dii tɛmɛne ra saba sodeni.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:6"/>Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna ito nan falaxi, a naxa, “Yanyina nde, yama dɔnxɛn naxan na lu, na kabɛma nɛn na feen ma na lɔxɔni, koni na mi n tan natɛrɛnama!” Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna falan nan na ra.<verse eid="ZEC 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:7"/>Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna ito nan falaxi, a naxa, “N nan n ma yamaan nakisima nɛn sogeteden nun sogegododen yamanane ma. <verse eid="ZEC 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:8"/>N fama nɛn e ra, e yi dɔxɔ Yerusalɛn taani. E findima nɛn n ma yamaan na, n yi findi e Ala ra, ɲɔndin nun tinxinni.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:9"/>Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna ito nan falaxi, a naxa, “Ɛ wɛkilɛ, ɛ tan naxanye falani itoe mɛma, nabine yi naxanye falama muxune yi Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna banxin bɛtɛn sama waxatin naxan yi a ti feen na. <verse eid="ZEC 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:10"/>Bayo benun na lɔxɔne, walikɛna hanma ɲingene wanla saranna mi yi sɔtɛ. Yaxune mi yi tinɲɛ yamaan yi mini hanma e so bɔɲɛ xunbenli. Amasɔtɔ n yi muxune luma e bode xili ma nɛn. <verse eid="ZEC 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:11"/>Koni iki n mi fa a ligama yama dɔnxɛni ito ra alo waxati danguxine,” Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna falan nan na ra. <verse eid="ZEC 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:12"/>“E sansiin sima nɛn bɔɲɛ xunbenli. Manpa binle bogima nɛn. Bɔxɔn balon naminima nɛn. Tule igen fama nɛn. N na birin soma nɛn yama dɔnxɛn yii e kɛɛn na. <verse eid="ZEC 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:13"/>Yuda bɔnsɔnna nun Isirayila kaane, ɛ bata yi findi danga muxune ra siyane tagi kii naxan yi, n na ɛ rakisima nɛn, ɛ yi baraka na kiini. Ɛ nama gaxu, ɛ wɛkilɛ.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:14"/>Amasɔtɔ Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna ito nan falaxi, a naxa, “Ɛ benbane to yi n naxɔlɔma, n na a ragidi nɛn n xa ɛ ɲaxankata, n mi nimisa. <verse eid="ZEC 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:15"/>Koni iki n mɔn bata a ragidi, n xa a faɲin naba ɛ xa, Yerusalɛn nun Yuda bɔnsɔnna muxune. Nayi, ɛ nama gaxu. <verse eid="ZEC 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:16"/>Ɛ xa feni itoe liga: Ɛ xa ɲɔndin fala ɛ bode xa, ɛ kitin sa ɲɔndini, kitin naxan bɔɲɛ xunbenla rasoma. <verse eid="ZEC 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:17"/>Muxu yo nama miriya ɲaxin tongo a boden xili ma. Ɛ nama ɛ kɔlɔ wuleni. Amasɔtɔ n na feene raɲaxuxi,” Alatalaa falan nan na ra.<verse eid="ZEC 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sun suxun maxɔdinna yabina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:18"/>Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna yi falan ti n xa, a naxa, <verse eid="ZEC 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:19"/>“Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna ito nan falaxi, a naxa: Kike naaninden sunna, kike suulunden sunna, kike solofereden sunna e nun kike fuden sunna, ne findima nɛn Yuda bɔnsɔnna sɛwa lɔxɔne nun ɲaxaɲaxa lɔxɔne ra, e nun sali lɔxɔne. Koni ɲɔndin nun bɔɲɛ xunbenla xa rafan ɛ ma de!”<verse eid="ZEC 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:20"/>Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna ito nan falaxi, a naxa, “Siya wuyaxine nun taa wuyaxi muxune mɔn fama nɛn. <verse eid="ZEC 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:21"/>Taa keden muxune fama nɛn taan bonna muxune ma, e naxa, ‘En siga Alatala maxandideni, en yi Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna fen! N tan fan sigama nɛn!’ <verse eid="ZEC 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:22"/>Nayi, yama wuyaxin nun siya sɛnbɛmane fama nɛn Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna fendeni Yerusalɛn taani, e yi a maxandi.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:23"/>Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna ito nan falaxi, a naxa, “Na lɔxɔne yi, xɛmɛ fu fama nɛn keli siyane birin yi naxanye xuine birin falama, e yi e singan Yahudiya keden ma domaan lenben na, e yi a fala, e naxa, ‘En birin nan sigama, amasɔtɔ nxu bata a mɛ a Ala i xɔn.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 8:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ZEC 9"/>
  <para style="s">Siya gbɛtɛne kitina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:1"/>Waliyiya falan ni i ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:1">Alatala falan naxan tixi Xadiraki yamanan xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:1">a Damasi taan li.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:1">Amasɔtɔ Alatala gbeen nan adamadiin bonne ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:1">alo Isirayila bɔnsɔnne birin.<verse eid="ZEC 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:2"/>A mɔn xa Xamata taan li,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:2">Damasi danna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:2">e nun Tire taan nun Sidɔn taana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:2">kolonna gbo dɛnaxan yi.<verse eid="ZEC 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:3"/>Tire taan bata yinna ti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:3">a bata gbetin malan</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:3">alo burunburunna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:3">A xɛmaan gbo alo kira xɔn borona.<verse eid="ZEC 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:4"/>Koni Marigina a bama a yii nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:4">a yi a yinna radin baani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:4">tɛɛn yi taan gan.<verse eid="ZEC 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:5"/>Asikalɔn kaane na toma nɛn e gaxu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:5">Gasa kaane fan gaxuma nɛn e xuruxurun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:5">e nun Ekirɔn kaane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:5">amasɔtɔ e yigitɛgɛma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:5">Mangayaan ɲanma nɛn Gasa taani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:5">Asikalɔn taani gelima nɛn.<verse eid="ZEC 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:6"/>Siya basanxin fa Asadodi taan tongoma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:6">n yi Filisitine wason kala.<verse eid="ZEC 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:7"/>N suben bama nɛn e dɛ wunla naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:7">e nun donse haramuxine.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:7">E dɔnxɛn naxanye na lu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:7">ne fan findima nɛn en ma Ala gbeen na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:7">E yi lu alo Yuda xabila kedenna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:7">Ekirɔn kaane luma nɛn alo Yebusu kaane.<verse eid="ZEC 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:8"/>Ganla naxanye danguma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:8">hanma naxanye fama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:8">n daaxama nɛn n ma yamaan makantandeni ne ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:8">E mi luma fitina muxu yo a nɔɔn bun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:8">amasɔtɔ iki n yɛɛn tixi e ra.<verse eid="ZEC 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mangan famatɔna</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:9"/>Siyon kaane, ɛ ɲaxan han!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:9">Yerusalɛn kaane, ɛ xuini te sɛwani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:9">Ɛ a mato!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:9">Ɛ mangan fama ɛ ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:9">A tinxin. A bata rakisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:9">A limaniya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:9">A fama sofanla nan fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:9">sofali diina, sofali gilɛn diina.<verse eid="ZEC 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:10"/>N yɛngɛ so wontorone bama nɛn Efirami yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:10">e nun soone Yerusalɛn taani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:10">Yɛngɛ so xanle kalama nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:10">A tan bɔɲɛ xunbenla ralima siyane ma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:10">A mangayaan xuyama ayi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:10">keli fɔxɔ igen ma han fɔxɔ igena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:10">keli baan ma han bɔxɔn danna.<verse eid="ZEC 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:11"/>Ɛ tan mabinni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:11">n na ɛ muxu suxine xunbama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:11">en ma layirin wunla fe ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:11">naxanye ramaraxi alo kasorasane yili kui xareni.<verse eid="ZEC 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:12"/>Ɛ mɔn xa so taa makantanxini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:12">ɛ tan kasorasaan naxanye yigi saxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:12">N mɔn xa a rali ɛ ma to:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:12">n ni i saranma nɛn dɔxɔɲa ma firin.<verse eid="ZEC 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:13"/>Amasɔtɔ n bata Yuda yitɔn alo xanla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:13">Efirami yi lu alo n ma xalimakunla.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:13">Siyon, n ni i ya dii xɛmɛne rakelima nɛn Girɛki kaane xili ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:13">N yi ɛ lu alo sofana silanfanna.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">9.13</char> <char style="fk">Silanfanna:</char> Sofane yɛngɛso dɛgɛmana.</note><verse eid="ZEC 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:14"/>Alatala a makɛnɛnma nɛn e xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:14">a xalimakunla yi siga alo kuye sarinna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:14">Marigina Alatala xɔtaan fema nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:14">a fa yiifari ma tule foyeni.<verse eid="ZEC 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:15"/>Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna e rakantanma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:15">E e dɛgema nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:15">e sigan ti lantan gɛmɛne fari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:15">E e minma nɛn sɛwani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:15">e sarin alo dɔlɔ minne.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:15">E lugo alo goron nafexina</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:15">alo saraxa ganden tongonne wasan wunla ra kii naxan yi.<verse eid="ZEC 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:16"/>Alatala, e Ala e rakisima nɛn na lɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:16">alo a xuruse kuruna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:16">E nɔrɔxin yi lu a yamanani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:16">alo gɛmɛ faɲine mangaya taxamaseri kɔmɔtin ma.<verse eid="ZEC 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:17"/>E tofanma nɛn han!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:17">E rayabuma nɛn han!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:17">Balon banxulanne ragboma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 9:17">minse faɲine yi sungutunne rayabu.<verse eid="ZEC 9:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ZEC 10"/>
  <para style="s">Ala nan bɔɲɛ xunbenla fima</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:1"/>Ɛ xa Alatala maxɔdin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:1">a xa tulen nafa ɛ ma ɲɛmɛn na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:1">A tan nan foyen nakelima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:1">a yi tule gbeen nafa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:1">a yi birin ma xɛɛn nasabati.<verse eid="ZEC 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:2"/>Amasɔtɔ wule falan nan suxurene ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:2">Yiimatone wule feene nan toma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:2">E wule xiye falane nan tima!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:2">E madɛndɛnna tima fala fuune nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:2">Nanara, yamaan bata siga a xun xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:2">e tɔrɔxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:2">alo kari mi xuruseen naxanye ma.<verse eid="ZEC 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:3"/>N bata xɔlɔ na xuruse rabane ma han!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:3">N yɛɛratine hakɛne saranma e ra nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:3">Amasɔtɔ Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:3">a ɲɔxɔ luma nɛn a kurun xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:3">a yamana, Yuda bɔnsɔnna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:3">A fama e ra nɛn yɛngɛni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:3">alo a soo kɛndɛne.<verse eid="ZEC 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:4"/>Kuntigine sifan birin minima a tan nin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:4">Banxin tongon gɛmɛ kɛndɛn minima a tan nin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:4">Bubu wudin minima a tan nin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:4">Yɛngɛ so xanla minima a tan nin.<verse eid="ZEC 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:5"/>E luma nɛn alo sofa wɛkilɛxine</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:5">naxanye e yaxune yibodonma yɛngɛni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:5">alo kira xɔn borona.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:5">Bayo Alatala e xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:5">e yɛngɛn soma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:5">e sofa soo ragine yarabi.<verse eid="ZEC 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:6"/>N Yuda bɔnsɔnna sɛnbɛ soma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:6">n yi Yusufu bɔnsɔnna rakisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:6">N mɔn e rafama nɛn e konni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:6">bayo n bata kininkinin e ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:6">E luma nɛn alo n mi e rabeɲin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:6">Alatala nan n tan na, e Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:6">n na e maxandine yabima nɛn.<verse eid="ZEC 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:7"/>Efirami kaane findima nɛn sofa wɛkilɛxine ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:7">E sɛwama nɛn alo e minxin na a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:7">E diine na toma nɛn, e ɲaxan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:7">e sɛwama nɛn Alatalaa fe ra.<verse eid="ZEC 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:8"/>N nan n ma yamaan xilima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:8">n yi e malan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:8">N na e xunbama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:8">e mɔn yi wuya alo a fɔlɔni.<verse eid="ZEC 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:9"/>Hali n to e raxuyaxi ayi siyane yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:9">n ma fe rabirama e ma nɛn yire makuyeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:9">E nun e diine yi kisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:9">e mɔn yi xɛtɛ.<verse eid="ZEC 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:10"/>N na e rafama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:10">keli Misiran yamanani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:10">n yi e malan keli Asiriya yamanani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:10">N fama nɛn e ra Galadi nun Liban yamanani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:10">koni e mi xanɲɛ mɛnni.<verse eid="ZEC 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:11"/>Ala baan walanne ragodoma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:11">e yi tɔrɔ baani gidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:11">hali Nila baan tilinne xɔrima nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:11">Asiriya yamanan wason kalama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:11">Misiran yamanan sɛnbɛn yi ɲan.<verse eid="ZEC 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:12"/>N tan nan e sɛnbɛ soma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:12">e yi sigan ti n xinli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 10:12">Alatalaa falan nan na ra.<verse eid="ZEC 10:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ZEC 11"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:1"/>Liban bɔxɔna, i ya dɛɛne rabi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:1">Tɛɛn xa i ya suman binle gan.<verse eid="ZEC 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:2"/>Fɔfɔ binle, ɛ gbelegbele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:2">amasɔtɔ suman wudin bata bira.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:2">Wudi gbeene bata kala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:2">Basan warine, ɛ gbelegbele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:2">amasɔtɔ fɔtɔn xɔlɛn bata kala.<verse eid="ZEC 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:3"/>Xuruse rabane bata gbelegbele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:3">amasɔtɔ e binyen waxatin bata dangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:3">Yatane bata wurundun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:3">bayo fɔtɔn gbeen bata kala Yurudɛn baan dɛ.<verse eid="ZEC 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Xuruse rabane</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:4"/>Alatala n ma Ala naxa iki:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:4">“I xa xuruse kuru faxa daxini ito raba.<verse eid="ZEC 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:5"/>Muxun naxanye e sarama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:5">ne e kɔɛ raxabama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:5">e kɛwali ɲaxin mi saran e ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:5">Naxanye e matima ne naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:5">‘Alatala tantun!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:5">N bata bannaya!’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:5">E raba muxune mi kininkininxi e ma.<verse eid="ZEC 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:6"/>Amasɔtɔ n mi fa kininkininma yamanan muxune ma,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:6">Alatalaa falan nan na ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:6">“N bata e birin lu e bode a yii ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:6">e nun e mangana yiin ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:6">E yamanan ɲaxankatama nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:6">N mi muxu yo bama e yii.”<verse eid="ZEC 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:7"/>Nayi, n yi xuruse kuru faxa daxin naba, katarabi xuruse tɔrɔxine ma. N yi dungan firin tongo. N yi keden xili sa “Fanna,” bonna “Lanna.” N yi xuruse kurun naba. <verse eid="ZEC 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:8"/>N yi xuruse raba saxan kedi kike kedenna bun. Diɲan yi ɲan n yi, n fan yi raɲaxu xuruseene ma. <verse eid="ZEC 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:9"/>Nayi, n yi a fala ne xa, n naxa, “N mi fa ɛ rabama. Xa naxan faxama, a xa faxa. Xa naxan lɔma ayi, a xa lɔ ayi. Naxanye na lu, ne xa e bode suben don.” <verse eid="ZEC 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:10"/>N yi n ma fanna dunganna tongo n yi a yigira, alogo n xa n ma layirin kala n naxan xidi nxu nun siyane birin tagi. <verse eid="ZEC 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:11"/>A yi kala na lɔxɔni, nayi xuruse tɔrɔxin naxanye yi n matoma na lɔxɔni, ne yi a kolon a Alatalaa falan nan yi a ra. <verse eid="ZEC 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:12"/>N yi a fala e xa, n naxa, “Xa a ɛ kɛnɛn, ɛ n saranna fi, xanamu, ɛ a lu na.” E yi gbeti gbanan tonge saxan fi n saranna ra. <verse eid="ZEC 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:13"/>Alatala yi a fala n xa, a naxa, “A wolɛ ayi fɛɲɛ rafalan xa, e saran gbeeni ito naxan mirixi n xa.” N yi gbeti gbanan tonge saxanna tongo, n yi e woli Alatala banxini fɛɲɛ rafalan xa. <verse eid="ZEC 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:14"/>Na xanbi ra, n yi n ma lan dunganna fan yigira alogo n xa ngaxakedenyaan kala Yuda nun Isirayila tagi.<verse eid="ZEC 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:15"/>Alatala yi a fala n xa, a naxa, “I mɔn xa xuruse raba xaxilitarena waliseene tongo. <verse eid="ZEC 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:16"/>Amasɔtɔ n tan yɛtɛɛn xuruse rabana nde rafama nɛn yamanani. A mi a yengi dɔxɛ xuruseene xɔn ma naxanye lɔma ayi, a mi a dii xali nɛnɛne fenɲɛ, a mi a maxɔlɔxine dandanɲɛ, a mi a kɛndɛne baloɛ. Koni a yɛxɛɛ turaxine donma nɛn a yi e toron koten.”<verse eid="ZEC 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:17"/>Gbalon na xuruse raba fuyantenna xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:17">naxan xuruseene rabeɲinma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:17">Silanfanna xa a yiin sɛgɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">11.17</char> <char style="fk">Silanfanna:</char> Sofane yɛngɛso dɛgɛmana.</note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:17">a yi a yiifari ma yɛɛn sɔxɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:17">A yiin xa faxa a ma fefe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 11:17">a yiifari ma yɛɛn yi xɔri.<verse eid="ZEC 11:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ZEC 12"/>
  <para style="s">Yerusalɛn xunba famatɔna</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:1"/>Waliyiya falan ni i ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:1">Alatala falan naxan tixi Isirayila fe yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:1">A tan naxan kore xɔnna nun bɔxɔ xɔnna daxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:1">a yi muxun niin sa a yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:1">Alatalaa falan ni ito ra:<verse eid="ZEC 12:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:2"/>N Yerusalɛn findima nɛn dɔlɔ min seen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:2">naxan a rabilinna siyane birin fugama a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:2">Yerusalɛn taan nabilinma nɛn yɛngɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:2">e nun Yuda yamanan birin.<verse eid="ZEC 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:3"/>Na lɔxɔni, n Yerusalɛn findima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:3">gɛmɛ binyen na siyane birin xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:3">Naxan yo na kata a yite feen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:3">na maxɔlɔma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:3">Bɔxɔn siyane birin e malanma nɛn a xili ma.<verse eid="ZEC 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:4"/>Alatalaa falan ni ito ra:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:4">Na lɔxɔni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:4">n faan nasoma nɛn e soone birin yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:4">n yi gaxun naso e soo ragine yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:4">Koni n nan n yɛɛn tima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:4">Yuda bɔnsɔnna muxune ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:4">N yi siyane soone birin yɛɛne xɔri.<verse eid="ZEC 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:5"/>Yuda mangane a falama nɛn e bɔɲɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:5">“Yerusalɛn muxune bata en sɛnbɛ so</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:5">Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna barakani, e Ala.”<verse eid="ZEC 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:6"/>Na lɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:6">n Yuda mangane luma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:6">alo tɛɛ wolonne yegene dɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:6">alo xaye radɛgɛxin malo xidine tagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:6">E fama e rabilinna siyane halagideni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:6">e kɔmɛnna nun e yiifanna ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:6">Koni Yerusalɛn kaane mɔn luma nɛn e konni.<verse eid="ZEC 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:7"/>Alatala Yuda dɔxɔdene nan singe rakisima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:7">alogo Dawuda yixɛtɛne nun Yerusalɛn muxune</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:7">binyen nama dangu Yuda muxune ra.<verse eid="ZEC 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:8"/>Na lɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:8">Alatala Yerusalɛn kaane ratangama nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:8">Hali naxan bata tagan e yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:8">a yɛngɛn soma nɛn na lɔxɔni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:8">alo Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:8">Dawuda yixɛtɛne fan luma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:8">alo Ala yɛtɛna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:8">alo Alatalaa malekana e yɛɛ ra.<verse eid="ZEC 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:9"/>Na lɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:9">n siyane birin naxɔrima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:9">naxanye fama Yerusalɛn xili ma.<verse eid="ZEC 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:10"/>Nayi, n hinanna nun maxandin niin nagodoma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:10">Dawuda yixɛtɛne ma e nun Yerusalɛn muxune.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:10">E yi e yɛɛ rafindi n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:10">e naxan yisɔxɔnxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:10">E sunuma nɛn a fe ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:10">alo dii keden peena.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:10">E a wugama nɛn sɔxɔlɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:10">alo dii singena.<verse eid="ZEC 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:11"/>Na lɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:11">sunun gboma ayi nɛn Yerusalɛn taani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:11">alo Xadada-Rimɔn ma sununa Megido mɛrɛmɛrɛni.<verse eid="ZEC 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:12"/>Yamanan sunuma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:12">xabilane birin yi lu e danna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:12">Dawuda bɔnsɔnna a danna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:12">e ɲaxanle fan e danna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:12">Natan bɔnsɔnna a danna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:12">e ɲaxanle fan e danna,<verse eid="ZEC 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:13"/>Lewi bɔnsɔnna a danna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:13">e ɲaxanle fan e danna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:13">Simayi bɔnsɔnna a danna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:13">e ɲaxanle fan e danna,<verse eid="ZEC 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:14"/>e nun bɔnsɔnna bonne birin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:14">Birin luma nɛn a danna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 12:14">e ɲaxanle fan yi lu e danna.<verse eid="ZEC 12:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ZEC 13"/>
  <para style="s">Suxurene nun wule nabine</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:1"/>Na lɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:1">tigin minima nɛn Dawuda yixɛtɛne xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:1">e nun Yerusalɛn muxune,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:1">alogo yulubine nun xɔsin xa ba e ma.<verse eid="ZEC 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:2"/>Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna falan ni ito ra:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:2">Na lɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:2">n suxurene xinle bama nɛn yamanani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:2">ɲinan yi ti e xɔn ma fefe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:2">N mɔn nabine nun xaxili ɲaxin bama nɛn yamanani.<verse eid="ZEC 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:3"/>Xa muxuna nde mɔn nabiya falan ti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:3">a nga nun a baba naxan a barixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:3">ne a falama a xa nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:3">e naxa, “I xa faxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:3">amasɔtɔ i bata wulen fala Alatala xinli.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:3">A nga nun a baba naxan a barixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:3">ne a sɔxɔnma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:3">a nɛma nabiya falane tima.<verse eid="ZEC 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:4"/>Na lɔxɔni, nabine birin yagima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:4">e fe toxine nun e waliyiya falane ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:4">E mi fa nabiya domaan soma sɔnɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:4">alogo e xa madaxun ti.<verse eid="ZEC 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:5"/>E birin a falama nɛn, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:5">“Nabi mi n na, xɛɛ biin nan n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:5">Amasɔtɔ muxuna nde n sara nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:5">xabu n dii ɲɔrɛ waxatini.”<verse eid="ZEC 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:6"/>Koni e a maxɔdinma nɛn, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:6">“Nanse laru itoe ra i kanken ma?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:6">A e yabima nɛn, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:6">“E n maxɔlɔ nɛn n xɔyine konni.”<verse eid="ZEC 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Silanfanna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:7"/>“Silanfanna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:7">i xa keli n ma xuruse rabaan xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:7">xɛmɛn naxan n fɛma.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:7">Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna falan ni ito ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:7">“Xuruse rabaan faxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:7">yɛxɛɛne xa xuya ayi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:7">N yi keli a xunxurine xili ma.<verse eid="ZEC 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:8"/>Nayi, yamaan dɔxɔde saxan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:8">firin faxama nɛn keden yi lu na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:8">Alatalaa falan nan na ra.<verse eid="ZEC 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:9"/>N yi a dɔnxɛn sa tɛɛni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:9">n yi a rasɛnsɛn alo gbetina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:9">N yi e mato tɛɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:9">alo xɛmaan matoon kii naxan yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:9">Nayi, e n maxandima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:9">n yi e yabi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:9">N na a falama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:9">‘N ma yamaan nan ne ra.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:9">E yi a fala, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 13:9">‘Alatala nan nxɔ Ala ra.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 13:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ZEC 14"/>
  <para style="s">Alatala fa lɔxɔna</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:1"/>Alatalaa lɔxɔn fama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:1">Yaxune ɛ seene yitaxunma nɛn ɛ yɛɛ xɔri.<verse eid="ZEC 14:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:2"/>N siyane birin malanma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:2">e yi Yerusalɛn yɛngɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:2">Taan suxuma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:2">Banxine yi kui geli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:2">E yi fu ɲaxanle ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:2">Taan fɔxɔ kedenna yi siga suxuni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:2">Koni yama dɔnxɛn luma nɛn taani.<verse eid="ZEC 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:3"/>Alatala kelima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:3">a yi na siyane yɛngɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:3">alo a yi yɛngɛn soma waxati gbɛtɛ yi kii naxan yi.<verse eid="ZEC 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:4"/>A tima nɛn na lɔxɔni Oliwi geyaan fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:4">naxan Yerusalɛn yɛtagi a sogeteden binni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:4">Oliwi geyani bɔma nɛn a tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:4">keli a sogeteden binni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:4">han a sogegodode binni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:4">Folo gbeen yi lu na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:4">Geyaan fɔxɔ kedenna xɛtɛma nɛn kɔmɛnna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:4">a fɔxɔ kedenna boden fan yi siga yiifanna ma.<verse eid="ZEC 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:5"/>Nayi, ɛ ɛ gima nɛn n ma geyane folon na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:5">Amasɔtɔ geyane folon sigama nɛn han Aseli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:5">Ɛ ɛ gima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:5">alo ɛ to ɛ gi bɔxɔ xuruxurunna yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:5">Yusiya waxatini, Yuda mangana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:5">Nayi, Alatala fama nɛn, n ma Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:5">e nun malekane birin.<verse eid="ZEC 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:6"/>Na lɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:6">kɛnɛn mi luma na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:6">hanma xunbenla hanma ige xundina.<verse eid="ZEC 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:7"/>E nun lɔxɔn bonne keden mi a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:7">Alatala nan na lɔxɔn kolon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:7">Yanyi mi luma na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:7">kɔɛ mi luma na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:7">Hali kɔɛɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:7">kɛnɛnna luma nɛn na.<verse eid="ZEC 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:8"/>Na lɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:8">siimaya igen minima nɛn Yerusalɛn taani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:8">A fɔxɔ kedenna yi siga sogetede baan binni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:8">a fɔxɔ kedenna yi siga sogegodode fɔxɔ igen binni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:8">A minima nɛn soge fure waxatini alo ɲɛmɛna.<verse eid="ZEC 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:9"/>Alatala nan findima bɔxɔn birin mangan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:9">Na lɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:9">Alatala nan keden yatɛma Ala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:9">a keden peen xinla yi lu na.<verse eid="ZEC 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:10"/>Yerusalɛn rabilinna bɔxɔn birin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:10">findima nɛn mɛrɛmɛrɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:10">keli Geba yi han Rimɔn yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:10">Yerusalɛn yiifanna ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:10">Yerusalɛn tima nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:10">Taan danne yi lu iki:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:10">Keli Bunyamin dɛɛn na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:10">han dɛ singen yireni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:10">han tongonna dɛna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:10">Keli Xananɛli sangansoon ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:10">han mangana manpa ige badena.<verse eid="ZEC 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:11"/>Muxune dɔxɔma nɛn taani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:11">A mi fa halagima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:11">Yerusalɛn luma nɛn bɔɲɛ xunbenli.<verse eid="ZEC 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:12"/>Siyaan naxanye Yerusalɛn yɛngɛxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:12">Alatala fitina fureni ito nan sama ne fari:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:12">E birin fatin kunma nɛn e ɲɛɲɛn na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:12">E yɛɛne kunma nɛn e yɛ yinla ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:12">e lɛnne fan yi kun e dɛ.<verse eid="ZEC 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:13"/>Na lɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:13">Alatala gaxu gbeen nasoma nɛn e yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:13">e yi e bode suxu e yiin ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:13">e yi e bode yɛngɛ.<verse eid="ZEC 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:14"/>Yuda kaane fan Yerusalɛn xun mayɛngɛma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:14">E e rabilinna siyane birin ma nafunle tongoma nɛn:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:14">xɛmaan nun gbetin nun dugi gbegbe.<verse eid="ZEC 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:15"/>Na fitina fure sifan soone nun gbaxalone<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">14.15</char> <char style="fk">Gbaxaloni</char> itoe sɔtɔma soon nun sofanla na diin sɔtɔ waxatin naxan yi.</note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:15">nun ɲɔgɔmɛne nun sofanle fan suxuma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:15">e nun xuruseen naxanye birin yaxune daaxadeni.<verse eid="ZEC 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:16"/>Nayi, siyaan naxanye birin Yerusalɛn yɛngɛxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:16">na muxu dɔnxɛne fama nɛn ɲɛɛ yo ɲɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:16">e Manga Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna batu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:16">e yi Bubu Kui Sanla raba.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">14.16</char> <char style="fk">Bubu Kui Sanla</char> fe sɛbɛxi Saraxaraline 23.33-38 kui.</note><verse eid="ZEC 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:17"/>Xa bɔxɔn xabilana nde tondi sigɛ Yerusalɛn taani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:17">Manga Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna batudeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:17">tulen mi fama e konni.<verse eid="ZEC 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:18"/>Xa Misiran kaane tondi sigɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:18">xa e mi fa, tulen mi fama na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:18">Alatala fitina furen nagodoma e ma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:18">a naxan nagodoma siyane ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:18">naxanye tondixi sigɛ Bubu Kui Sanla rabadeni.<verse eid="ZEC 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:19"/>Ala Misiran kaane fe ɲaxin saranma e ra na kii nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:19">a siyane yulubine birin saran e ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:19">naxanye mi sigama Bubu Kui Sanla rabadeni.<verse eid="ZEC 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:20"/>Na lɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:20">hali talandin naxanye singanxi soone ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:20">a sɛbɛma nɛn ne ma fa fala:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:20">“A Sariɲanxi Alatala xa.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:20">Tunden naxanye Alatalaa banxini</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:20">ne fan yatɛma nɛn se rasariɲanxine ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:20">alo saraxa ganden goronne.<verse eid="ZEC 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:21"/>Tunden naxanye birin Yerusalɛn nun Yuda yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:21">ne birin nasariɲanma nɛn Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:21">Naxanye birin fama saraxa badeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:21">ne nde xalima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:21">alogo e xa sa kudin so e kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:21">Na lɔxɔni, sare mati yo mi fa luma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ZEC 14:21">Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna batu banxini.<verse eid="ZEC 14:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 14"/>
</usx>
